        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge, Optimize, and Conquer in This Strategic Roguelike Auto-Battler!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the shared inventory of your party of adventurers and guide them through a perilous journey across a shifting map filled with shops, forges, and dangerous enemies. Your entire team shares a <strong>9×9 inventory grid</strong>, where careful placement of gear is crucial—not just for space, but to activate the powerful <strong>grid bonuses</strong> provided by your chosen heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/3c9b6429a9e8357cb8d2bfe0e3e86019.poster.avif?t=1763500918\" width=620 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/3c9b6429a9e8357cb8d2bfe0e3e86019.webm?t=1763500918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Grid-Based Inventory System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, every item matters. Gear comes in Tetris-like shapes ranging from 1 to 5 tiles, and fitting them together within your limited grid space is a strategic puzzle. Each adventurer contributes distinct bonuses to specific grid tiles, so choosing who to bring—and how to arrange their equipment—is key to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes with Exclusive Skills and Grid Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and experiment with a growing roster of characters, each offering their own <strong>exclusive abilities</strong> and <strong>bonus zones</strong> on the shared grid. Build your team to suit your strategy and discover powerful combinations that adapt to each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge and Reshape Your Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials during your journey and use them in the forge to <strong>upgrade</strong>, <strong>combine</strong>, or even <strong>reshape your items</strong>. Making a weapon smaller may allow more gear to fit, while expanding it might cover more grid bonuses for stronger effects. Flexibility is essential in managing your evolving inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/0020893ee9ab16cd09ec75127b73e754.poster.avif?t=1763500918\" width=620 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/0020893ee9ab16cd09ec75127b73e754.webm?t=1763500918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/0020893ee9ab16cd09ec75127b73e754.mp4?t=1763500918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat and Handcrafted Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few steps, you’ll face off against enemy parties composed of a mix of <strong>procedurally generated</strong> opponents and <strong>handcrafted challenges</strong> designed by the developer. These <strong>auto-battles</strong> test your strategic planning, equipment synergy, and adaptability. Survive long enough, and you’ll face a powerful boss with unique mechanics tailored to test your final loadout.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes for Varied Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in different ways with a variety of <strong>game modes</strong>. Play with three characters, take on a minimalist challenge with only one, or face scenarios where the final boss is revealed in advance to aid your preparation. You can even <strong>challenge friends</strong> by sharing custom combat configurations for them to overcome with their own builds—perfect for testing creativity and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage your inventory, forge the ideal equipment, and outwit your enemies in this deep and replayable roguelike adventure. Will you master the grid and forge a path to victory?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge, Optimize, and Conquer in This Strategic Roguelike Auto-Battler!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the shared inventory of your party of adventurers and guide them through a perilous journey across a shifting map filled with shops, forges, and dangerous enemies. Your entire team shares a <strong>9×9 inventory grid</strong>, where careful placement of gear is crucial—not just for space, but to activate the powerful <strong>grid bonuses</strong> provided by your chosen heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/3c9b6429a9e8357cb8d2bfe0e3e86019.poster.avif?t=1763500918\" width=620 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783460/extras/3c9b6429a9e8357cb8d2bfe0e3e86019.webm?t=1763500918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique Grid-Based Inventory System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, every item matters. Gear comes in Tetris-like shapes ranging from 1 to 5 tiles, and fitting them together within your limited grid space is a strategic puzzle. Each adventurer contributes distinct bonuses to specific grid tiles, so choosing who to bring—and how to arrange their equipment—is key to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes with Exclusive Skills and Grid Influence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and experiment with a growing roster of characters, each offering their own <strong>exclusive abilities</strong> and <strong>bonus zones</strong> on the shared grid. Build your team to suit your strategy and discover powerful combinations that adapt to each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge and Reshape Your Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mat